{"id":"a61be48bb6776bfc","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-hagino-functor.md","title":"多项式类型函子与代数范畴","display":"df-hagino-functor — 多项式类型函子与代数范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-hagino-functor","aliases":["16-df-hagino-functor"],"display":"df-hagino-functor — 多项式类型函子与代数范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-lambda-systems]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Lemma 8.2.1 pp.457–458 (PDF 477–478); explicit quotient and algebra categories","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-hagino-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-hagino-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hagino-functor — 多项式类型函子与代数范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9691785e1689a2c1\" href=\"?note=9691785e1689a2c1\" title=\"16-df-lambda-systems\">16-df-lambda-systems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 8.2.1 pp.457–458 (PDF 477–478); explicit quotient and algebra categories"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9691785e1689a2c1\" href=\"?note=9691785e1689a2c1\" title=\"16-df-lambda-systems\">16-df-lambda-systems</a> 的 λ2 演算及类型变量语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span>，在每个类型语境中额外加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,+\">\\(0,+\\)</span>；其项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{abort}_A(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{abort}_A(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)\">\\(\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)\\)</span>。下文扩展该页的有限位置树与绑定深度表，并在扩展后的树域上重新实例化原有五族规则；新规则和原规则统一进入显式有限正闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin\\Xi\">\\(X\\notin\\Xi\\)</span> 为指定类型变量；常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 遍历不含自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的已形成类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,D\">\\(A,B,D\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span> 中的类型。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_P\">\\(F_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)\\)</span> 在本页构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]_\\equiv\">\\([t]_\\equiv\\)</span> 是良型项的转换等价类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]:A\\to B\">\\([t]:A\\to B\\)</span> 在固定Hom中简写带源靶的箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)\">\\((A,B,[t]_\\equiv)\\)</span>，所有合成及函子等式均在这些带标签类中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span> 的对象/箭头全体及运算在下文明确组装。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1\\)</span> 为标准有序对的第一投影；代数结构对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,a)\">\\((A,a)\\)</span>、余代数结构对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,c)\">\\((A,c)\\)</span> 的第一分量均为载体类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_P\">\\(F_P\\)</span> 是下文组装的对象/箭头映射对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_P(A)\">\\(F_P(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_P([f])\">\\(F_P([f])\\)</span> 分别表示其两个分量的作用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是下列有限 Hagino 类型树。自由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span> 保持固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P[A/X]\">\\(P[A/X]\\)</span> 为类型替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)\\)</span> 在下文按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 递归，论域是下述扩展类型语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 及任意项语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中的良型项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash f:A\\to B\">\\(\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash f:A\\to B\\)</span>，不限于闭项；递归生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,x,y\">\\(z,x,y\\)</span> 总先取为对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,f\">\\(\\Gamma,f\\)</span> 新鲜的变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{map}_P^{A,B}\">\\(\\operatorname{map}_P^{A,B}\\)</span> 保留为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n\">\\(k=n\\)</span> 的原接口，省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 时由所示型属确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0\">\\(B_0\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9691785e1689a2c1\" href=\"?note=9691785e1689a2c1\" title=\"16-df-lambda-systems\">16-df-lambda-systems</a> 中的基本类型符号集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|\\Xi|,m=|\\Gamma|\">\\(n=|\\Xi|,m=|\\Gamma|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+,\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+,\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+\\)</span> 是下列完整文法的最小有限树族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf W\">\\(\\mathsf R,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf W\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9691785e1689a2c1\" href=\"?note=9691785e1689a2c1\" title=\"16-df-lambda-systems\">16-df-lambda-systems</a> 的递归式及本页扩充后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\">\\(\\mathbf d\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf T,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf{Req}\">\\(\\mathsf F,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf T,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf{Req}\\)</span> 沿用同一判断标签及函数式，参数域改为这些扩展树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_+\">\\(\\mathcal J_+\\)</span> 为这四种判断在扩展域上的记录集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\lambda2}^+\">\\(\\mathcal S_{\\lambda2}^+\\)</span> 是原页五族规则模式在扩展域上的原始实例集；规则实例的准入不测试可推导性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_+^{\\rm ext}\">\\(\\mathcal S_+^{\\rm ext}\\)</span> 是下列形成、项、同余及 β/η 分式模式在扩展树域上的全部原始实例集；每个实例编码为有限前提集与结论记录的有序对，只检查所示原始文法、位置与新鲜性条件，不以可推导性筛选。分式中的判断用对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F,\\mathsf T,\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf F,\\mathsf T,\\mathsf E\\)</span> 记录编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 总为相应项语境之外的新位置名。本页未加下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash,\\equiv\">\\(\\vdash,\\equiv\\)</span> 均按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_+\">\\(\\mathcal D_+\\)</span> 解释；命名表面记号的单项替换使用相应位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S\">\\(\\mathsf S\\)</span>。省略的注释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{inl},\\mathrm{inr}\">\\(\\mathrm{inl},\\mathrm{inr}\\)</span> 由该规则或显示型属中的两支类型确定。函子律中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 分别取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B),\\mathcal C_\\Xi(B,D)\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B),\\mathcal C_\\Xi(B,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|\\Xi|\">\\(n=|\\Xi|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq n\">\\(k\\geq n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 是前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个位置等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span> 的长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的类型变量语境。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T)\\)</span> 的输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_k^+\">\\(T\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_k^+\\)</span>；模式树的变量叶、常量叶、零、单位、积、和使用互异的构造子标签；常量叶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 携带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\\vdash C\">\\(\\Xi\\vdash C\\)</span> 的类型树，扩展时通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{k-n,0}\">\\(\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{k-n,0}\\)</span> 移入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span>。下文带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的 map 公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\vdash A\">\\(\\Theta\\vdash A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\vdash B\">\\(\\Theta\\vdash B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\vdash\\Gamma\">\\(\\Theta\\vdash\\Gamma\\)</span>；不带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的原函子及代数范畴仍在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span> 中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 用于型属相容式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf W\">\\(\\mathsf W\\)</span> 采用本页已扩充文法上的既定位置树递归。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+\\ni A::={}&amp;b\\ (b\\in B_0)\\mid a_i\\ (i\\in[n])\\mid0\\mid1\n\\mid A\\times A\\mid A+A\\mid A\\to A\\mid\\forall C\\mid\\exists C,\n\\quad C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{n+1}^+,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+\\ni t::={}&amp;v_j\\ (j\\in[m])\\mid\\star\\mid\\langle t,u\\rangle\\mid\\pi_i t\n\\mid\\lambda(A,q)\\mid\\mathrm{app}(t,u)\\mid\\Lambda r\\mid\\mathrm{tapp}(t,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\mid\\mathrm{pack}(C,A,t)\\mid\\mathrm{unpack}(t,w)\n\\mid\\mathrm{abort}(A,t)\\mid\\mathrm{inl}(A,D,t)\\mid\\mathrm{inr}(A,D,t)\n\\mid\\mathrm{case}(t,q,q&#39;),\\\\\n&amp;t,u\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+,\\quad q,q&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m+1}^+,\n\\quad r\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n+1,m}^+,\\quad w\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n+1,m+1}^+,\\\\\n&amp;A,D\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+,\\quad C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{n+1}^+,\\quad i\\in\\{1,2\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf d(0)&amp;\\coloneqq(),\\quad\n\\mathbf d(+)\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0)),\\\\\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{abort})&amp;\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0)),\\\\\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{inl})&amp;\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0),(0,0)),\\quad\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{inr})\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0),(0,0)),\\\\\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{case})&amp;\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,1),(0,1)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{abort}_A(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{abort}(A,t),\\quad\n\\mathrm{inl}_{A,D}(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{inl}(A,D,t),\\quad\n\\mathrm{inr}_{A,D}(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{inr}(A,D,t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{case}(t,u,v).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+\\ni A::={}&amp;b\\ (b\\in B_0)\\mid a_i\\ (i\\in[n])\\mid0\\mid1\n\\mid A\\times A\\mid A+A\\mid A\\to A\\mid\\forall C\\mid\\exists C,\n\\quad C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{n+1}^+,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+\\ni t::={}&amp;v_j\\ (j\\in[m])\\mid\\star\\mid\\langle t,u\\rangle\\mid\\pi_i t\n\\mid\\lambda(A,q)\\mid\\mathrm{app}(t,u)\\mid\\Lambda r\\mid\\mathrm{tapp}(t,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\mid\\mathrm{pack}(C,A,t)\\mid\\mathrm{unpack}(t,w)\n\\mid\\mathrm{abort}(A,t)\\mid\\mathrm{inl}(A,D,t)\\mid\\mathrm{inr}(A,D,t)\n\\mid\\mathrm{case}(t,q,q&#39;),\\\\\n&amp;t,u\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+,\\quad q,q&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m+1}^+,\n\\quad r\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n+1,m}^+,\\quad w\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{n+1,m+1}^+,\\\\\n&amp;A,D\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+,\\quad C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{n+1}^+,\\quad i\\in\\{1,2\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf d(0)&amp;\\coloneqq(),\\quad\n\\mathbf d(+)\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0)),\\\\\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{abort})&amp;\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0)),\\\\\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{inl})&amp;\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0),(0,0)),\\quad\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{inr})\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,0),(0,0)),\\\\\n\\mathbf d(\\mathrm{case})&amp;\\coloneqq((0,0),(0,1),(0,1)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{abort}_A(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{abort}(A,t),\\quad\n\\mathrm{inl}_{A,D}(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{inl}(A,D,t),\\quad\n\\mathrm{inr}_{A,D}(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{inr}(A,D,t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{case}(t,u,v).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_+^{\\rm ext}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{}{\\Xi\\vdash0}\\qquad\\frac{\\Xi\\vdash A\\quad\\Xi\\vdash B}{\\Xi\\vdash A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:0\\quad\\Xi\\vdash A}{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{abort}_A(t):A},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A\\quad\\Xi\\vdash B}{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t):A+B}\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Xi\\vdash A\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:B}{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t):A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A+B\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u:D\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:0\\quad\\Xi\\vdash D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{abort}_D(t)\\equiv\\mathrm{abort}_D(t&#39;):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:A\\quad\\Xi\\vdash B}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t)\\equiv\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t&#39;):A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\vdash A\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:B}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t)\\equiv\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t&#39;):A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:A+B\\quad\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u\\equiv u&#39;:D\\quad\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v\\equiv v&#39;:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)\\equiv\\mathrm{case}(t&#39;;x.u&#39;,y.v&#39;):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u:D\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t);x.u,y.v)\\equiv u[t/x]:D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:B\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u:D\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t);x.u,y.v)\\equiv v[t/y]:D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A+B\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash w:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash w[t/z]\\equiv\n\\mathrm{case}(t;x.w[\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(x)/z],y.w[\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(y)/z]):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:0\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,z:0\\vdash w:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash w[t/z]\\equiv\\mathrm{abort}_D(t):D}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_+^{\\rm ext}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{}{\\Xi\\vdash0}\\qquad\\frac{\\Xi\\vdash A\\quad\\Xi\\vdash B}{\\Xi\\vdash A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:0\\quad\\Xi\\vdash A}{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{abort}_A(t):A},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A\\quad\\Xi\\vdash B}{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t):A+B}\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Xi\\vdash A\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:B}{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t):A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A+B\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u:D\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:0\\quad\\Xi\\vdash D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{abort}_D(t)\\equiv\\mathrm{abort}_D(t&#39;):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:A\\quad\\Xi\\vdash B}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t)\\equiv\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t&#39;):A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\vdash A\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:B}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t)\\equiv\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t&#39;):A+B},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv t&#39;:A+B\\quad\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u\\equiv u&#39;:D\\quad\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v\\equiv v&#39;:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)\\equiv\\mathrm{case}(t&#39;;x.u&#39;,y.v&#39;):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u:D\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t);x.u,y.v)\\equiv u[t/x]:D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:B\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash u:D\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,y:B\\vdash v:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathrm{case}(\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t);x.u,y.v)\\equiv v[t/y]:D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A+B\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,z:A+B\\vdash w:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash w[t/z]\\equiv\n\\mathrm{case}(t;x.w[\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(x)/z],y.w[\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(y)/z]):D},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:0\\quad\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma,z:0\\vdash w:D}\n{\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash w[t/z]\\equiv\\mathrm{abort}_D(t):D}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_+&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(P\\cup\\mathsf{Req}(j),j)\\mid\n(P,j)\\in\\mathcal S_{\\lambda2}^+\\cup\\mathcal S_+^{\\rm ext},\\\nP\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathcal J_+),\\ j\\in\\mathcal J_+\\},\\\\\nD_+^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nD_+^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq D_+^k\\cup\n\\{j\\in\\mathcal J_+\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D_+^k)\\ (P,j)\\in\\mathcal R_+\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_+&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}D_+^k,\\\\\n\\Xi\\vdash A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf F(\\Xi,A)\\in\\mathcal D_+,\\\\\n\\Xi\\vdash\\Gamma&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf C(\\Xi,\\Gamma)\\in\\mathcal D_+,\\\\\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf T(\\Xi,\\Gamma,t,A)\\in\\mathcal D_+,\\\\\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf E(\\Xi,\\Gamma,t,u,A)\\in\\mathcal D_+.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_+&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(P\\cup\\mathsf{Req}(j),j)\\mid\n(P,j)\\in\\mathcal S_{\\lambda2}^+\\cup\\mathcal S_+^{\\rm ext},\\\nP\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathcal J_+),\\ j\\in\\mathcal J_+\\},\\\\\nD_+^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nD_+^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq D_+^k\\cup\n\\{j\\in\\mathcal J_+\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D_+^k)\\ (P,j)\\in\\mathcal R_+\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_+&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}D_+^k,\\\\\n\\Xi\\vdash A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf F(\\Xi,A)\\in\\mathcal D_+,\\\\\n\\Xi\\vdash\\Gamma&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf C(\\Xi,\\Gamma)\\in\\mathcal D_+,\\\\\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t:A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf T(\\Xi,\\Gamma,t,A)\\in\\mathcal D_+,\\\\\n\\Xi\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf E(\\Xi,\\Gamma,t,u,A)\\in\\mathcal D_+.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Xi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\mid\\Xi\\vdash A\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)\\mid\\Xi\\mid\\varnothing\\vdash t:A\\to B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}_A&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.x],\\qquad\n[g]\\circ[f]\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.g(fx)],\\\\\nP&amp;::=X\\mid C\\mid0\\mid1\\mid P\\times Q\\mid P+Q,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{X,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq T,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{C,k}(T)\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{k-n,0}(C),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{0,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathsf{Inst}_{1,k}(T)\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P\\times Q,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T)\\times\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(T),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P+Q,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T)+\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(T),\\\\\nP[A/X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,n}(A),\\\\\n(F_P)_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq P[A/X],\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{X,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{C,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda z:\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{k-n,0}(C).z,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{0,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\lambda z:0.z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{map}_{1,k}^{A,B}(f)\\coloneqq\\lambda z:1.z,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{P\\times Q,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda z:\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(A)\\times\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(A).\n\\langle\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)(\\pi_1z),\\operatorname{map}_{Q,k}^{A,B}(f)(\\pi_2z)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{P+Q,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda z:\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(A)+\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(A).\n\\mathrm{case}(z;x.\\mathrm{inl}(\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)x),y.\\mathrm{inr}(\\operatorname{map}_{Q,k}^{A,B}(f)y)),\\\\\n\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash f:A\\to B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f):\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(A)\\to\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf W_{k,0}^{r,0}(\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T))&amp;=\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k+r}(\\mathsf W_{k,0}^{r,0}(T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{P}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{map}_{P,n}^{A,B}(f),\\\\\n(F_P)_1([f])&amp;\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{map}_P^{A,B}(f)]\\quad(\\Xi\\mid\\varnothing\\vdash f:A\\to B),\\\\\nF_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(F_P)_0,(F_P)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nF_P(\\operatorname{id}_A)&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{F_P(A)},\\qquad\nF_P(g\\circ f)=F_P(g)\\circ F_P(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Xi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\mid\\Xi\\vdash A\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)\\mid\\Xi\\mid\\varnothing\\vdash t:A\\to B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}_A&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.x],\\qquad\n[g]\\circ[f]\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.g(fx)],\\\\\nP&amp;::=X\\mid C\\mid0\\mid1\\mid P\\times Q\\mid P+Q,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{X,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq T,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{C,k}(T)\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{k-n,0}(C),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{0,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathsf{Inst}_{1,k}(T)\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P\\times Q,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T)\\times\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(T),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P+Q,k}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T)+\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(T),\\\\\nP[A/X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,n}(A),\\\\\n(F_P)_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq P[A/X],\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{X,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{C,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda z:\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{k-n,0}(C).z,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{0,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\lambda z:0.z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{map}_{1,k}^{A,B}(f)\\coloneqq\\lambda z:1.z,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{P\\times Q,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda z:\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(A)\\times\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(A).\n\\langle\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)(\\pi_1z),\\operatorname{map}_{Q,k}^{A,B}(f)(\\pi_2z)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{P+Q,k}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda z:\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(A)+\\mathsf{Inst}_{Q,k}(A).\n\\mathrm{case}(z;x.\\mathrm{inl}(\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)x),y.\\mathrm{inr}(\\operatorname{map}_{Q,k}^{A,B}(f)y)),\\\\\n\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash f:A\\to B&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f):\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(A)\\to\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf W_{k,0}^{r,0}(\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T))&amp;=\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k+r}(\\mathsf W_{k,0}^{r,0}(T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{map}_{P}^{A,B}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{map}_{P,n}^{A,B}(f),\\\\\n(F_P)_1([f])&amp;\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{map}_P^{A,B}(f)]\\quad(\\Xi\\mid\\varnothing\\vdash f:A\\to B),\\\\\nF_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(F_P)_0,(F_P)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nF_P(\\operatorname{id}_A)&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{F_P(A)},\\qquad\nF_P(g\\circ f)=F_P(g)\\circ F_P(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Xi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\mid\\Xi\\vdash A\\},\\qquad M_\\Xi\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A,B\\in O_\\Xi}\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B),\\\\\ns_\\Xi(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t_\\Xi(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_\\Xi(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_A,\\qquad c_\\Xi([g],[f])\\coloneqq[g]\\circ[f],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Xi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Xi,M_\\Xi,s_\\Xi,t_\\Xi,e_\\Xi,c_\\Xi\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C_\\Xi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Xi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\mid\\Xi\\vdash A\\},\\qquad M_\\Xi\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A,B\\in O_\\Xi}\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B),\\\\\ns_\\Xi(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t_\\Xi(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_\\Xi(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_A,\\qquad c_\\Xi([g],[f])\\coloneqq[g]\\circ[f],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Xi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Xi,M_\\Xi,s_\\Xi,t_\\Xi,e_\\Xi,c_\\Xi\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C_\\Xi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Xi,\\ a\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(F_P(A),A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)((A,a),(B,b))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(A,a),(B,b),h\\rangle\\mid h\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B)\\land h\\circ a=b\\circ F_P(h)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,c)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Xi,\\ c\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,F_P(A))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)((A,c),(B,d))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(A,c),(B,d),h\\rangle\\mid h\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B)\\land d\\circ h=F_P(h)\\circ c\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Xi,\\ a\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(F_P(A),A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)((A,a),(B,b))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(A,a),(B,b),h\\rangle\\mid h\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B)\\land h\\circ a=b\\circ F_P(h)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(A,c)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Xi,\\ c\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,F_P(A))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)((A,c),(B,d))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(A,c),(B,d),h\\rangle\\mid h\\in\\mathcal C_\\Xi(A,B)\\land d\\circ h=F_P(h)\\circ c\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\mathcal A&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A,\\qquad\nM_\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{Q,R\\in O_\\mathcal A}\\mathcal A(Q,R),\\\\\ns_\\mathcal A\\langle Q,R,h\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq Q,\\qquad t_\\mathcal A\\langle Q,R,h\\rangle\\coloneqq R,\\\\\ne_\\mathcal A(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,Q,\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{pr}_1Q}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\mathcal A(\\langle R,S,k\\rangle,\\langle Q,R,h\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,S,k\\circ h\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\mathcal A,M_\\mathcal A,s_\\mathcal A,t_\\mathcal A,e_\\mathcal A,c_\\mathcal A\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal A)\n\\quad(\\mathcal A\\in\\{\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P),\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\mathcal A&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A,\\qquad\nM_\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{Q,R\\in O_\\mathcal A}\\mathcal A(Q,R),\\\\\ns_\\mathcal A\\langle Q,R,h\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq Q,\\qquad t_\\mathcal A\\langle Q,R,h\\rangle\\coloneqq R,\\\\\ne_\\mathcal A(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,Q,\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{pr}_1Q}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\mathcal A(\\langle R,S,k\\rangle,\\langle Q,R,h\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,S,k\\circ h\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\mathcal A,M_\\mathcal A,s_\\mathcal A,t_\\mathcal A,e_\\mathcal A,c_\\mathcal A\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal A)\n\\quad(\\mathcal A\\in\\{\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P),\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Lemma 8.2.1 pp.457–458（PDF477–478），以及该节加入有限余积的约定。开放项递归 map 与商范畴函子 F 分开：前者可作用于含自由项参数的函数项，后者只作用于闭项类。用转换等价的输入项替代，逐构造子同余使 map 输出仍等价，故 F 不依赖代表元。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的树高归纳，积与和的分支给出良型函数；逐构造子同余保证代表元无关，β/η 给恒等与复合保持。代数及余代数范畴的恒等和合成继承 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span>，其方程由函子律封闭。源靶标签同时保留类型和代数结构，故不会把不同结构之间的相同底层函数箭头混为同一个全局箭头。最后的统一组装公式分别以已给出的两个Hom族实例化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1\\)</span> 取结构对象的载体类型。</p>\n<p>本页使用原书的多项式 Hagino 范围，允许不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的任意固定类型作常量；不把它扩大成所有可定义严格正类型构造子。余积的强 η／交换规则也明确在前两节中；不存在类型不是由弱 Church 编码偷换而来。</p>\n<p>扩展类型语境时，多项式常量先按位置树弱化，变量叶再由该语境中的输入类型实例化；map 的同一个参数 k 贯穿全部递归分支。原函子只取 k=n，而量词绑定子中的开放项使用 k=n+1 等明确实例，避免把不在固定范畴对象域中的新类型变量直接交给该函子。类型弱化相容式由模式树归纳得到。</p>\n<p>新增构造子的所有类型注释与两个 case 分支的绑定深度均纳入位置树递归，所以原有重命名、弱化和同时替换在扩展语法上有确定值。形成、同余及 β/η 作为同一最小正闭包的规则使用；尤其不能只加入几个裸转换等式而省略新的构造子同余。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-lambda-systems","status":"resolved","id":"9691785e1689a2c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-lambda-systems]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-systems","status":"resolved","id":"9691785e1689a2c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-lambda-systems]] 的 λ2 演算及类型变量语境 $\\Xi$，在每个类型语境中额外加入 $0,+$；其项构造子为 $\\mathrm{abort}_A(t)$、$\\mathrm{inl}_{A,B}(t)$、$\\mathrm{inr}_{A,B}(t)$、$\\mathrm{case}(t;x.u,y.v)$。下文扩展该页的有限位置树与绑定深度表，并在扩展后的树域上重新实例化原有五族规则；新规则和原规则统一进入显式有限正闭包。$X\\notin\\Xi$ 为指定类型变量；常量 $C$ 遍历不含自由 $X$ 的已形成类型。$A,B,D$ 为 $\\Xi$ 中的类型。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_\\Xi$、$F_P$、$\\operatorname{Alg}(F_P)$、$\\operatorname{Coalg}(F_P)$ 在本页构造；$[t]_\\equiv$ 是良型项的转换等价类，$[t]:A\\to B$ 在固定Hom中简写带源靶的箭头 $(A,B,[t]_\\equiv)$，所有合成及函子等式均在这些带标签类中。$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组；$\\mathcal C_\\Xi$ 的对象/箭头全体及运算在下文明确组装。$\\operatorname{pr}_1$ 为标准有序对的第一投影；代数结构对象 $(A,a)$、余代数结构对象 $(A,c)$ 的第一分量均为载体类型 $A$。$F_P$ 是下文组装的对象/箭头映射对，$F_P(A)$、$F_P([f])$ 分别表示其两个分量的作用。$P$ 是下列有限 Hagino 类型树。自由参数 $\\Xi$ 保持固定，$P[A/X]$ 为类型替换。$\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}^{A,B}(f)$ 在下文按 $P$ 递归，论域是下述扩展类型语境 $\\Theta$ 及任意项语境 $\\Gamma$ 中的良型项 $\\Theta\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash f:A\\to B$，不限于闭项；递归生成的 $z,x,y$ 总先取为对 $\\Gamma,f$ 新鲜的变量。$\\operatorname{map}_P^{A,B}$ 保留为 $k=n$ 的原接口，省略 $A,B$ 时由所示型属确定。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-systems","status":"resolved","id":"9691785e1689a2c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B_0$ 为 [[16-df-lambda-systems]] 中的基本类型符号集；$n=|\\Xi|,m=|\\Gamma|$；$\\mathsf{Ty}_n^+,\\mathsf{Raw}_{n,m}^+$ 是下列完整文法的最小有限树族。$\\mathsf R,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf W$ 使用 [[16-df-lambda-systems]] 的递归式及本页扩充后的 $\\mathbf d$；$\\mathsf F,\\mathsf C,\\mathsf T,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf{Req}$ 沿用同一判断标签及函数式，参数域改为这些扩展树。$\\mathcal J_+$ 为这四种判断在扩展域上的记录集，$\\mathcal S_{\\lambda2}^+$ 是原页五族规则模式在扩展域上的原始实例集；规则实例的准入不测试可推导性。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-systems","status":"reso